"performance, we recommend keeping this below <strong>500</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1009
msgid "Schedule Frequency"
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1010
msgid ""
"Decide how often the plugin should check for new videos.<br><br>Options "
"include <strong>Only Once</strong>, <strong>Every Hour</strong>, "
"<strong>Daily</strong>, <strong>Weekly</strong>, or <strong>Monthly</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1016
msgid "Auto-Continue"
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1017
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want the plugin to keep checking for new videos "
"even after the initial import is complete."
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1023
msgid "Video Settings"
msgstr ""

#: premium/admin/automations.php:1024
msgid ""
"Decide how imported videos should be handled:<br><br>- Assign "
"<strong>categories</strong> and <strong>tags</strong>.<br>- Set a "
"<strong>featured image</strong>.<br>- Assign an <strong>author</strong>."
"<br>- Set the default <strong>status</strong> (e.g., Published, Pending)."
"<br>\n"
"- And more — explore the available fields to customize your import exactly "
"the way you want.<br><br>For extra control, set the status to "
"<strong>Pending</strong> so the site admin gets notified by email for review."
